&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Casa21 Workshops — Vinteum&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;July 27, 2024, at 10:00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Casa21, São Paulo, Brazil&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="about-the-workshop" class="relative group"&gt;About the workshop &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#about-the-workshop" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;nix-bitcoin is a collection of Nix packages and NixOS modules for installing full-featured Bitcoin nodes, with an emphasis on security. The workshop introduces Nix, the package manager and functional programming language, and NixOS, then covers using nix-bitcoin on a local machine, in virtual machines, and in the cloud. I also demonstrated installing NixOS on DigitalOcean using &lt;a href="https://github.com/elitak/nixos-infect" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;nixos-infect&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>